    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48434" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θερμαν-τικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>capable of heating, calorific</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πῦρ θ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Int.</u>
					22b38
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ οἶνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					58
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				60
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ θ. πρὸς τὸ -τὸν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Metaph.</u>
					1020b29
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				6.3.6
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Cael.</u>
				307a1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.19.4
			</span></i>: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τῆς ψυχῆς θ. οἶνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					60a
				</span></i>
			.</div>
